<https://www.ghezelbaash.ir/#answer-prp-and-mesotherapy-hair-loss-limitations> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Answer> .
<https://www.ghezelbaash.ir/#answer-prp-and-mesotherapy-hair-loss-limitations> <https://schema.org/author> <https://www.ghezelbaash.ir/#saeed-ghezelbash> .
